<title>USA: Cinemark USA Inc Q4 revs up.</title>
<headline>Cinemark USA Inc Q4 revs up.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Summary</p>
<p>	    For the Fiscal Fourth Quarter and Year Ended</p>
<p>			  December 31, 1996 and December 31, 1995</p>
<p>				  (In Thousands)</p>
<p>				Fourth Quarter Ended  Year Ended</p>
<p>				    December 31,    December 31,</p>
<p>				 1996	1995	1996	 1995</p>
<p> Total Revenues	 $86,268    $72,711 $341,731    $298,559</p>
<p> Operating Income*	7,416	6,285   34,308	35,361</p>
<p> EBITDA**		  12,768     11,114   59,508	53,928</p>
<p> Net Earnings	 4,559 (a)	4,009  5,230 (a)    13,155</p>
<p>*  Total revenues less cost of operations, depreciation and amortization and general and administrative expenses.</p>
<p>** Represents operating income plus non cash items included in operating income.</p>
<p>(a) Includes extraordinary loss of $.3 million for the quarter and $9.4 million for the annual period, net of related tax benefit, resulting from the early extinguishment of debt.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1700</p>
</text>
